        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Helensvale, Gold Coast, Queensland, Australia\n- People: Helena White\n- Topics: Population, city ranking, place naming\n\nFacts:\n- Helensvale is a suburb on the Gold Coast in Queensland, Australia.\n- Helensvale was named after Helena White.\n- In 2016, the Gold Coast had a census-estimated population of 638,090.\n- In 2016, the Gold Coast was the sixth-largest city in Australia.\n- In 2016, the Gold Coast was the largest non-capital city in Australia.\n- In 2016, the Gold Coast was the second-largest city in Queensland.",
